<title>USA: APS Holding names Kay-Bee Toy exec CFO.</title>
<headline>APS Holding names Kay-Bee Toy exec CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>APS Holding Corp said on Wednesday it named John Hendrix vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Hendrix, 48, spent the last five years with Kay-Bee Toy Stores, where he held a variety of financial management posts.</p>
<p>Most recently, he was senior vice president, chief financial officer, treasurer and secretary.</p>
<p>The company did not say whom Hendrix was replacing.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1600</p>
</text>
